**Merged repos** (no longer exist as separate packages):
- `unified-trade-execution-interface` → `execution-service`
- `unified-defi-execution-interface` → `execution-service`
- `unified-sports-execution-interface` → `execution-service`
- `unified-position-interface` → `position-balance-monitor-service`
- `unified-reference-data-interface` → `instruments-service`
- `unified-internal-contracts` → `unified-api-contracts` (internal/ subpackage)

**Uninstall eliminated packages:**
```bash
uv pip uninstall unified-trade-execution-interface unified-defi-execution-interface unified-sports-execution-interface unified-position-interface unified-reference-data-interface unified-internal-contracts
```

**Install order** (dependency order for workspace venv IDE type hints):

```bash
cd $WORKSPACE_ROOT  # or /path/to/unified-trading-system-repos
source .venv-workspace/bin/activate

# 1. matching-engine-library (no deps on other local libs)
uv pip install -e matching-engine-library

# 2. execution-algo-library
uv pip install -e execution-algo-library

# 3. execution-service (contains all execution adapters)
pip install -e execution-service --no-deps

# 4. instruments-service (contains reference data)
pip install -e instruments-service --no-deps

# 5. position-balance-monitor-service (contains position interface)
pip install -e position-balance-monitor-service --no-deps
```

